# strand-eval reference recordings (docs/eval.md, "Reference recordings"). Written by `strand-eval approve` and `verdict`; a block edited by hand fails its seal.
ref "popup-shrink-centred"
verdict good
note "roll-rate: a spring now settles when its amplitude sqrt(x^2 + (v/w0)^2) is within its tolerance, a moment of its curve and not of the frames sampling it; read against the old run per segment and node, every difference is a spring ending at another tick, snapped within its tolerance, and what waits for it (an unmount, a glide into its room, a stagger's turn) starting that much sooner; no frame of a spring before its end changed"
